course: dictionary
lesson: 13979
title: Located: where something is
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Located is the past form of locate. If something is located in a place, it is there, in that exact spot. Locate, locates, located and locating all come from one word, so you can understand all of them once you know this one.
explain: «The café is located on the first floor.» This tells you where the café is: on the first floor. Signs, maps and websites often use located to tell you where something can be found.
explain: «The searchers located the lost dog in the woods.» Here located means they found the exact position of the dog. Context helps: searchers look for something, so located must mean they found it.
explain: To check your meaning, swap in a simpler word such as "is" or "found". If the sentence still makes sense, you have understood located.
fact: Located means "is in a place" or "was found at an exact position".
fact: «Located» is the past form of «locate», so locate, locates, located and locating all come from one word.
fact: «The town is located on the coast.» means the town is on the coast.
fact: «Conveniently located» means in a place that is easy to get to.
fact: On maps, a point is located using coordinates, which give its exact position.
exercise: «The café is located on the first floor.» What does located mean here? | Is very loud | Is closed for the day | *Is in that place | Has been cooked
exercise: «The searchers located the lost dog in the woods.» What did they do? | Painted the dog | Lost the dog again | *Found the exact place where the dog was | Ran past the dog
exercise: Find and copy the word that is the past form of locate: «The shop was located near the bus stop.» | near | *located | shop | stop
test: «The hotel is conveniently located near the train station.» What does conveniently located suggest? | *Easy to get to | Closed on Sundays | Hard to reach | Hidden under the ground
test: A sign says: «The park is located behind the school.» Mia wants to know where the park is. What does the sign tell her? | *The park is behind the school | The park is closed | The park is a long way away | The park is inside the school
exam: «Using a map, Sam located the village after an hour of searching.» What does located mean here? | Drew | Forgot | Lost | *Found the exact position of
